    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord answered Job:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will the one who contends with the Almighty correct him?",
          "Let him who argues with God give an answer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then Job answered the Lord:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am so insignificant. How can I answer you?",
          "I place my hand over my mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I have spoken once, and I will not reply;",
          "twice, but now I can add nothing."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then the Lord answered Job from the whirlwind:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Get ready to answer me like a man;",
          "when I question you, you will inform me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Would you really challenge my justice?",
          "Would you declare me guilty to justify yourself?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do you have an arm like God’s?",
          "Can you thunder with a voice like his?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Adorn yourself with majesty and splendor,",
          "and clothe yourself with honor and glory."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pour out your raging anger;",
          "look on every proud person and humiliate him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look on every proud person and humble him;",
          "trample the wicked where they stand."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hide them together in the dust;",
          "imprison them in the grave."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then I will confess to you",
          "that your own right hand can deliver you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look at Behemoth,",
          "which I made along with you.",
          "He eats grass like cattle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look at the strength of his back",
          "and the power in the muscles of his belly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He stiffens his tail like a cedar tree;",
          "the tendons of his thighs are woven firmly together."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His bones are bronze tubes;",
          "his limbs are like iron rods."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He is the foremost of God’s works;",
          "only his Maker can draw the sword against him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The hills yield food for him,",
          "while all sorts of wild animals play there."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He lies under the lotus plants,",
          "hiding in the protection of marshy reeds."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lotus plants cover him with their shade;",
          "the willows by the brook surround him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Though the river rages, Behemoth is unafraid;",
          "he remains confident, even if the Jordan surges up to his mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Can anyone capture him while he looks on,",
          "or pierce his nose with snares?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
